{"ref":"BDB, בִּלהָה","hw":"בִּלהָה","html":"† II. <big><span dir=\"rtl\">בִּלהָה</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.loc.</strong> a city of Simeon <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 4:29\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.4.29\">1 Ch 4:29</a>, prob. = <span dir=\"rtl\">בַּעֲלָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 15:29\" href=\"/Joshua.15.29\">Jos 15:29</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">בָּלָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 19:3\" href=\"/Joshua.19.3\">19:3</a> cf. Di; site dub.","next":"BDB, בִּלְהָן","prev":"BDB, בִּלְהָה"}